  ],
  "sourceBindingLimit": "Tracked source proves Cell expressibility only. Legacy PlatformingModuleDefinition port/anchor validation is not the Foundation boundary contract; implementation must use the current existing compiler/adaptor and real Harness, never shift canonical boundary Ports inward to satisfy a legacy check.",
